[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0010","text":"——这是下次联合演唱会用的新服装\n你看这里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0020","text":"啊——\n拼布……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0030","text":"呵呵，好巧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0040","text":"哈哈，也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0050","text":"……但是，像这样大胆地\n把拼布用在服装上——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0060","text":"我完全没想到……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0070","text":"——是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0080","text":"这种大胆，\n我觉得千雪也有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0090","text":"制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21601300_02_0100","text":"……呵呵\n非常棒的灵感，谢谢您"}]
